WEBVTT

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.440
The semifinals of the City Tournament.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.740
Our match with the Kawahara International Heavenly.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.120
In order to go up against the genius striker, Aoto-kun,

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.250
we had Kota-kun man-mark him.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.330
But when we were about to tie the game up,

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:39.640
I made a disastrous own goal!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.980
Jeez! What was I doing!?

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.810
We have to win this game, no matter what.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:48.940
I have the same thoughts, too.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.320
Hard for me to say this, but me too.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.690
Yes! Me, too!

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:55.520
I see.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.820
There is a way! And if it's you guys, it's possible!

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.030
Now it's finally the second half!

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.080
That was unexpected.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.400
Hmm?

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.400
Kota-kun saying something like that.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:45.370
I thought he was only interested in his match with Aoto-kun.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:49.460
The team's result should have been secondary.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:53.200
That just means this team is special to him.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.290
What about us?

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:56.930
I don't know.

00:02:56.930 --> 00:03:01.790
Looks like the coach wants us to keep slugging it out with each other.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.340
Let's just have fun while smashing them in, then.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:08.410
I just want to beat them down.

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:14.590
Time for the Speed Star to shine!

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.670
I'll have you notice me this time!

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.100
The Predators changed their positions?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:31.480
Huh? Ouzou-kun is up in front now.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.290
Erika-chan, too.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:37.290
Looks like they moved around a bit.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.250
Masaru-chan-san gave them instructions, it seems.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.200
I'm looking forward to this.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.700
We've gotten into an attacking position.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:52.190
I have to be careful and tighten up on defense.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.460
Onii-chan!

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:58.340
Fix your own mistake yourself!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.190
Oh no!

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:01.970
I know!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.850
Over here!

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:20.970
Crap!

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:21.970
Clear it! Clear it!

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:26.700
Ouzou-kun, you're not enjoying this at all, are you?

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.600
Oh well.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.160
Our goal is to conquer the entire nation.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.950
We need to work hard here.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:42.990
Run!

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.680
Mark him!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:47.800
Mark! Mark!

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:49.120
Be careful!

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.090
Ouzou-kun!

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:50.660
Don't let them advance!

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.250
Watch out!

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.300
Mark them!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.520
Be careful!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.940
What's this movement?

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.740
That's...

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:02.190
That's it! Go! Go! Triplets!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.110
Tch!

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.030
That's fine. Not bad at all.

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:18.600
Maybe I shouldn't be telling you this,

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:22.660
but I think you should help out on defense.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:27.200
We'll just keep on pummeling you guys during the second half.

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.330
Why are you being so respectful, all of a sudden?

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:37.050
I already told you. I'm not the one who has been marking you so far.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.750
Oh?

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.560
In any case,

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:45.750
your keeper this year can't defend 
as much space as the one last year.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:49.720
Why did you switch him out?

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.950
Oh well. Not my problem.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.340
No!

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.850
Don't shoot it yourself!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.310
Pass it to Aoto quickly!

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:18.270
The focus of this team will be on Aoto.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.980
Everyone will be trying to feed him.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.390
Okay!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:33.860
Looks like the Coach has high expectations for you.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.940
Oh well, that's to be expected.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.460
Aren't you feeling the pressure after all that?

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:41.960
Not really.

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.190
I just score goals.

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:46.350
Haha, I see.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.280
I only see in front of me.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:51.720
Tagi, you protect the space behind me, right?

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:56.770
Yep. Leave it to me!

00:06:58.630 --> 00:06:59.890
Aoto!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:07.900
Mark him!

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:20.460
Kota.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:25.060
Do you understand Aoto's quirk that Ouzou was talking about?

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:28.640
If Ouzou figured it out, then I probably know, too.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:29.860
Okay.

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:33.720
Join in on the offense when we are attacking.

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:37.730
Mark Aoto when he gets to our third of the pitch.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:38.720
Okay.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:41.150
I'll leave Aoto to you.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:44.590
<i>You</i> decide how to defend against him.

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.420
You're quitting soccer?

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.400
Yes.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:08.830
My body doesn't move as I want it to.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:15.000
I can read the course of the ball, but I can't react fast enough.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:20.060
I can't do the moves I used to be able to do.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:24.770
I already knew that I was pretty bad at soccer.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.360
Sorry.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.320
I can't watch your back anymore.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:34.390
You're not bad at soccer, Tagi!

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.980
I'm not the same as you, Aoto.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.210
Aoto...

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:58.470
Now!

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:08.630
Big Tri!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.260
Clear it! Clear it!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.080
Oh! So close!

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:28.400
Shou! That play just now...

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:29.290
Sorry!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.660
Oh?

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:36.090
I didn't give out my orders fast enough, 
so Uematsu-kun couldn't make it on time.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:38.140
I'll watch out next time.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.370
Yeah. Please do.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:43.880
Us triplets can understand each other quite well.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:47.490
The others are always a step behind.

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:51.200
Please help them out with your orders.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:52.530
Okay!

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.090
Kota beat him this one time.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:04.680
But...

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:06.820
He'll be serious the next time.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.470
Aoto!

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:42.370
<i>You</i> decide how to defend against him.

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:46.660
Kota, we'll...

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.160
...leave it to you.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.080
Don't back off! Surround him!

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:52.380
The three of us?

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:53.420
You sure?

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.420
Winning the game comes first!

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:57.090
You're right.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.840
Roger that.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:06.220
That Kota!?

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.450
I'm stunned.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:10.140
Go!

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.050
Move forward!

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.910
Uematsu-kun! Erika-chan!

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.690
Hey!

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:31.870
Over here!

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.840
It's a fake!

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:46.180
Yes!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.850
We did it! We're tied!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.110
Nice decision.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:03.570
That was my chance to shine!

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:08.210
Oh well.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:09.540
Now we're tied.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.630
Don't mind, Aoto!

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:18.910
They're playing dirty, piling three players to defend against you.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:20.500
We're still tied.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:23.290
Let's pay them back in full force.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.760
We'll pass the ball to you, so please score.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.060
Well...{Um...}

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:31.010
We're changing our strategy.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:47.490
Aoto-kun changed his position.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.370
Eh!?

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:53.290
Aoto-kun...

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:54.750
...passed!?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.200
They're fast!

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:09.690
Uchimura-kun! Press forward!

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:12.850
Kota-kun, mark Aoto-kun!

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:14.350
They're going to the opposite side! Reika-chan!

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.780
They can play a passing game, too!?

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:28.840
It's here!

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:35.290
Hey! I haven't touched the ball yet!

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:40.340
I was naive to think this was a one-man team.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:44.720
Aoto's teammates are pretty disciplined to be able to keep up with his speed.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:14.790
Crap!

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:24.830
I got it!

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:26.090
And...

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:28.430
He noticed me!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.030
B-Build!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:36.120
What am I getting so scared about!?

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.920
This is a No Guard offense!

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.480
We have to keep up the scoring!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.460
Small Tri!

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.400
It's the Reverse Three, jeez!

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:05.750
Ouzou-kun!

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:28.570
Nice try!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:30.720
So close, Onii-chan!

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:34.290
Thirty centimeters from your celebratory cake!

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.160
That was so close.

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.550
Too bad.

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:42.380
Yeah. Sorry.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:43.630
Kota-kun!?

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:46.100
Kota!

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:46.690
Kota-kun!?

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:48.000
What happened!?

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.050
Are you okay!?

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:59.150
Will he be okay?

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:00.820
Leave the rest to me.

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:03.980
Please do your best with ten players for now.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.480
Okay.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.880
Will they be okay, Hanashima-kun!?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.930
They have to hang in there for now.

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:32.530
Masaru-chan!

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:37.020
I bought you some drinks and ice for now.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.520
Okay. Thanks.

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:42.020
Here. Use these.

00:16:43.590 --> 00:16:45.850
Hey, can I go back already?

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:48.350
Not until your pain is gone!

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:55.780
Come back! Mark #9!

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:57.370
Tanaka-kun! Cover that space!

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:07.170
Ouzou-kun!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:13.470
We're not just down to ten players.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:17.790
Ryuuji and Ouzou's play have gotten sloppy.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:24.940
The triplets can only play at full potential with all three of them, huh?

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:26.810
Crap!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.190
Small Tri!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.320
It's the Reverse Three!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.940
Oh well.

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:38.650
Ukishima-kun! Follow Aoto-kun!

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:41.990
Tanaka-kun! Reika-chan! #9 and #10!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:46.790
Crap.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:49.540
Oh no!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.710
Kubota-kun!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:55.960
Nice save!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.580
That little kid is amazing.

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:15.810
Eh?

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:17.610
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:25.520
Aoto-kun can pull off a shot like that, too?

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:28.790
Now's not the time to admire him!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.550
We have no time left!

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:46.350
We have to tie things up at least!

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:55.820
So close!

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:01.240
Everyone! Fall back!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.330
Don't force things!

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.580
Slow things down and maintain possession!

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:11.980
Is he trying to eat up time?

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:13.300
Focus!

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:15.590
Ryuuji! Ramp up the pressure!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:20.180
Ouzou! Erika! Find space and run!

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:23.180
Shou! Don't space out! Scream!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:25.600
Don't slow down! Run!

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:29.600
Masaru-chan is getting too excited.

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:35.110
5 minutes left? I wonder how much additional time we'll be getting.

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.520
Crap.

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:41.270
We'll lose like this...

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.260
What are you doing?

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:46.790
I'm not hurting anymore.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.750
Don't lie.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.360
I'm going.

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:51.750
No!

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:55.420
Are you sure? You want to lose?

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:58.680
Not me.

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:03.590
I'd be in a lot more pain if the team loses!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.400
Try jumping.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.690
Listen up.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.660
I'll be pulling you out if I sense anything wrong.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.180
Don't use your right foot to shoot.

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.440
Okay.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:32.430
Who are you guys!?

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:34.080
The Predators!

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.870
We're carnivores.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.650
Reika-chan, knock it out!

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:49.010
Kota-kun!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.440
Are you okay?

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:51.730
Yes.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.120
I was a bit worried.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:55.940
You sure it doesn't hurt?

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:56.650
You sure?

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.540
I'm fine!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:00.110
Let's get this started.

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.090
Don't let the triplets run buck wild!

00:21:19.090 --> 00:21:20.120
Man-mark them!

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:22.120
Aoto! Mark number 10!

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:28.140
You? On defense? Don't make me laugh.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:34.640
You still can't tell the difference between us?

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:37.060
You took the ball from me before.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.310
Let me pay you back.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.780
Why don't you try, then?

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:55.120
Kota-kun's sweating that much!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.330
That guy is still...

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:04.260
That idiot used his right foot!

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.630
Erika-chan!

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:22.690
Yes! Nice shot!

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:25.160
We're tied up again!

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:26.530
Wow! Wow!

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:29.820
Kota-kun!

00:22:29.820 --> 00:22:31.660
Your foot!

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:33.740
I told you I'm fine!

00:22:35.810 --> 00:22:38.370
Next time we score, we win!

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:41.160
Jeez, that fool.

00:22:41.950 --> 00:22:45.300
But good job.

00:22:46.750 --> 00:22:49.380
If we keep this up, it's a tie.

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:54.510
During penalty kicks, we're at a disadvantage due to our lack of depth.

00:22:54.510 --> 00:22:57.550
I want us to come back and win...

00:22:57.550 --> 00:22:59.410
...but there's no...

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:03.240
There's no time left!

00:24:35.450 --> 00:24:37.620
Shou-kun! Do you think we can win?

00:24:37.620 --> 00:24:38.660
I don't know.

00:24:38.660 --> 00:24:40.370
I'm worried about Kota-kun's injury,

00:24:40.370 --> 00:24:41.800
but we just have to do our best!

00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:43.210
Next up will be Amarillo if we win.

00:24:43.210 --> 00:24:45.170
It doesn't get any easier!

00:24:45.170 --> 00:24:47.880
Okay! Time to ask the soccer gods!

00:24:47.880 --> 00:24:49.630
Hey! It's starting to rain!

00:24:49.630 --> 00:24:51.380
You'll be asking the rain gods then!

00:24:51.380 --> 00:24:53.380
Next episode of Ginga e Kickoff!

00:24:53.380 --> 00:24:54.510
Tears!
